ALGORITHM METROPOLIS
NDIM            3
RHO 0.05
RCUT 5.0
NBINS_GOFR      100
NBINS_POFV      100
DT              0.001
DELTA           0.1

-----------------------------

  - POSSIBLE ALGORITHMS: VERLET, METROPOLIS
  - 'RCUT' MUST BE SMALLER THAN HALF-BOX DIMENSION, COMPUTED FROM 'NDIM' AND 'RHO'
  - 'DT' IS ONLY USED WHEN 'ALGORITHM == VERLET'
  - 'DELTA' IS ONLY USED WHEN 'ALGORITHM == METROPOLIS'
